# Only the site and the files it reads go online: index.html, site/ (except its README), public/, data/tests.web.json,
# data/tests.meta.json, data/investigations.json and docs/ai-usage-log.md (linked from the footer). Everything else in docs/ stays private,
# including notes added later, so a new doc is never published by accident.
# Plans, the video build folder, the full source data and the build scripts stay in the repo only.
/tools
/scripts
/lib
/docs/*
!/docs/ai-usage-log.md
/site/README.md
/data/tests.json
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/README.md
/.env.example
/Codex
/.qa
